  "composer": {
    "accepted_prose": "Tomi tilted her head, considering. “Honestly? It depends on the day. If I've pushed hard and I'm really winded, I usually want silence—just let my breathing come back on its own. But on a normal cooldown, yeah, music can help shift my headspace. So it's not a yes or no for me. It's more… situational.”\n\nHer answer hung for a moment before Yuuni piped up from beside her. “I mean… I could. If Tomi ever asks for one. I've got playlists already sorted for different vibes, so it's not like it's extra work. But I'm not gonna just drop one right now. She'd have to actually ask first.” She shrugged, a hint of smugness in her tone.",
